      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Image Loading in SDK3 is also not working in Quest.\n\n[Build: 1282] Image loader on quest loads images upside down\n\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/vrchat-udon-closed-alpha-bugs/p/build-1282-image-loader-on-quest-loads-images-upside-down",
